[node name="BackroomsLevel2" type="Node3D"]
## The Lost Passage's second modeled depth — darker, lower-ceilinged,
## and denser with hazards than level1, per "going deeper means harder/
## stranger geometry." No artifacts/doors down here on purpose: the
## exit hunt stays exclusively in level1 (see BackroomsArtifact/Door);
## this level is pure deeper-exploration risk/reward — more pits,
## dimmer light, one stairs-up back to level1.

